With polypile you want a lot of stacks in the same pile because the beam
has a very short range.  That means name, drop a dozen, name again, drop
another dozen, repeat until finished.  Do that without naming and they
will all stack on the ground.

Polymorph zap a pile that is a single stack of 300 arrows and your
chances of getting nothing is better than your chances of getting a
ton of silver daggers.  Polymorph zap a pile that is 30 stacks of 10
arrows and your chances of getting silver daggers is a lot higher.


